# ORIGINA Laravel

Read `AGENTS.md` before implementation. It is the repository-level authority.

Current phase is frontend completion. Do not add database, authentication, APIs, commerce, payments, admin persistence, enquiry persistence or external-integration behaviour unless the owner explicitly expands scope.

The owner has approved a complete institutional frontend refinement. Use `origina-next` as an approved content/structure reference, not a pixel-lock. Preserve scientific meaning and brand assets while following this repository's design system and frontend architecture.

Use Blade components, semantic HTML, semantic CSS tokens, native scrolling, progressive enhancement and WCAG 2.2 AA practices.

Do not invent claims, regulatory status, patents, clinical outcomes, credentials or operating status for future entities.

Keep changes in small Conventional Commits. Git history belongs to the human maintainer; never add agent/AI/bot authorship or co-author trailers.

When architecture, security, content governance, scope, assets or the design system changes, update the relevant documentation in the same workstream.
